url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24391973"
abstract: >
  Replication package for the paper "Failure-Directed Reaction-Data Curation
  for Few-Shot Exact-SMILES Product Prediction: In-Domain Gains under a
  Chemical LLM Evaluation Protocol without Cross-Split Generalization"
  (Li et al., 2026; manuscript paper/RSI_paper_v9.md). Includes the
  v9_g1prime dataset (46 train / 97 eval), clean hold-out set (n=31,
  reaction-key-disjoint), locked recipe configuration (Qwen2.5-7B + LoRA,
  bf16), paper figures, and all training / evaluation / mechanism
  validation scripts.
keywords:
  - reaction-data curation
  - chemical LLM evaluation protocol
  - recursive self-improvement
  - data-centric AI
  - failure-directed curation
  - few-shot learning
  - chemical reaction prediction
  - evaluation integrity
